{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32171","headline":"长安寺 · 温庭筠","name":"长安寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仁祠写露宫，长安佳气浓。\n烟树含葱蒨，金刹映䒠茸。\n绣户香焚象，珠网玉盘龙。\n宝题斜翡翠，天井倒芙蓉。\n幡长回远吹，牕虚含晓风。\n游骑迷青锁，归鸟思华钟。\n云栱承跗逦，羽葆背花重。\n所嗟莲社客，轻荡不相从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}